            "body": "No open issue that I could find: the closest are #35890, which added the single per-namespace slot (a1bc5d0ae6), and #40802  / #40869, the same kind of bug in set().\r\n\r\nGiven #39792, I reworked this to use one global BufRead/BufWipeout pair like #40869 instead of an autocmd per buffer and handler. \r\n",
